6.1 Applications Beyond Driving Assistance
We demonstrated that adaptive voice instructions help improve driving as the drivers’ cognitive load might cause them to react differently to the events happening on the roads. The differences in

their capability of attending to voice information require adaptation. We expect AdaptiveVoice to be beneficial for a broader range of applications beyond driving assistance, as long as users’ cognitive load dynamically changes when they are immersed in a task and

